      "Description": "<h5 class='system-title'>Camera Hot Shoe Cover Fruit Cartoon Design for Canon Nikon Sony Leica DSLR Mirrorless Universal Protective Cap</h5>\n<div class='system-intro'></div>\n<div class='system-description'><ul><li><p>【Fruit-Shaped Design】Features 9 realistic fruit designs including lychee, strawberry, and pineapple that add personality and charm to your camera while providing protection.</p></li><li><p>【Hot Shoe Protection】Perfectly covers the top interface slot of cameras with standard hot shoe mounts, effectively protecting against dust and damage.</p></li><li><p>【Premium Material Construction】Made from high-quality eco-friendly resin combined with PVC base, offering delicate texture and lifelike appearance with vivid detail craftsmanship.</p></li><li><p>【Universal Compatibility】Bottom hot shoe cover features optimal tightness for secure installation on most DSLR and mirrorless camera brands without easy detachment.</p></li><li><p>【Lightweight & Portable】Weighing only 12-15g per piece, the compact design adds no burden to shooting while providing colorful enhancement to your camera.</p></li><li><p>【Dual-Purpose Functionality】Can be used not only as camera accessory but also as cute decorative figurines for desks or shelves, offering versatile usage.</p></li></ul><h2>Specifications:</h2><ul><li>Material: Resin + PVC</li><li>Product Dimensions: 2.5 x 2.5 x 3 cm</li><li>Compatible Device Type: DSLR, Mirrorless Camera</li><li>Interface Type: Standard Hot Shoe Mount</li><li>Design Options: 9 Fruit Varieties (Lychee, Strawberry, Pineapple, etc.)</li></ul></div>\n",
